  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 76cc206b62ed0cc469348cb7a2733a87, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  currentTestDescription: "Step 5a: full click protocol under normal mix with counter
    visibility. Run all 5 scenarios; capture Inspector after each. Trust ears first;
    counters are diagnostic. Rewrite CURRENT TEST before a different testing round
    (\xA79)."
  currentTestSessionTimeSeconds: 0
  currentTestFailure: 0
  currentTestMicExitReason: 
  currentTestMicRawRingWriteTotalSamples: 0
  currentTestImitoneInputAudioCallTotal: 0
  currentTestDbMicrophoneTearDetectedTotal: 0
  currentTestAudioCallbackHzRolling: 0
  currentTestDbValue: 0
  currentTestPitchHz: 0
  currentTestMonUnderflowEvents: 0
  currentTestMonOverflowEvents: 0
  currentTestMonStarvationEvents: 0
  currentTestMonHardVolumeStepCount: 0
  inspectorInterpretationGuideReference: "F1 HYBRID \u2014 Main thread is ring PRODUCER
    (UpdateMicReadFrame polls Microphone / GetData). Audio thread is CONSUMER (OnAudioFilterRead
    feeds imitone from rawRingBuffer; DirectVoiceMonitoring also reads rings).\r\n\r\nUNIVERSAL
    PASS \u2014 FAILURE stays false (composite OR of every FAIL_*).\r\n\r\nFAIL PHASE
    2 (audio thread) \u2014 FAIL_AUDIO_CALLBACK_FROZEN / RATE_LOW / GAP_HIGH. FAIL_AUDIO_LOCK_CONTENTION
    uses aggRawRingReadLockMissTotal (rawBufferLock TryEnter misses), not legacy
    ring-write lock.\r\n\r\nFAIL PHASE 3 (imitone feed) \u2014 FAIL_IMITONE_NOT_FED;
    FAIL_IMITONE_FEED_RATIO_LOW.\r\n\r\nFAIL PHASE 1 \u2014 FAIL_UNREAD_ZERO_SUSTAINED
    (compare aggUnreadZeroConsecutiveFrames to thresholds; exit reason may flicker
    unread_zero on chunk drivers). FAIL_INGEST_RING_STALLED. FAIL_MONITORING_STARVATION_GROWING.
    FAIL_MIC_NOT_READY. FAIL_DB_TEAR_DETECTED (sticky).\r\n\r\nMIC PRODUCER \u2014
    aggMicRawRingWriteTotalSamples climbs at sample rate while capturing. Sticky
    unhealthy exit reasons: stalled_capture_stopped, device_unavailable, invalid_mic_position.\r\n\r\nIMITONE
    FEED \u2014 aggImitoneInputAudioCallTotal tracks aggAudioCallbackTotal. aggAudioFeedOverflowDroppedTotal
    = read-side overflow drops (prefer 0). Gap ms/samples \u2014 stable band while
    toning.\r\n\r\nMONITORING \u2014 aggMonUnderflowEvents / aggMonOverflowEvents
    / aggMonStarvationEvents (steady-state climb bad).\r\n\r\nRETIRED (do not hunt
    in Inspector) \u2014 FAIL_AUDIO_GC_ALLOC_DETECTED; FAIL_RING_OVERFLOW_GROWING
    + phantom skip counter (5b-iv); FAIL_GENTLE_RECOVERY_FIRED (5b-ii)."
  FAILURE: 0
  FAIL_AUDIO_CALLBACK_FROZEN: 0
  FAIL_AUDIO_CALLBACK_RATE_LOW: 0
  FAIL_AUDIO_CALLBACK_GAP_HIGH: 0
  FAIL_AUDIO_LOCK_CONTENTION: 0
