  m_Text: 'Excessive light intensity is the most common cause of discomfort in the
    SoundSelf experience.


    If the user suffers from migraines or epilepsy, remove
    the glasses now for an audio-only experience.


    Lights being "off" at the
    beginning of the session is normal.'
